{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Avcodec.Subtitle</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"ffmpeg-avcodec","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Avcodec","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Subtitle","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Subtitle codecs: lookup only. This module builds no subtitle decoder or encoder. Subtitles are decoded and encoded through containers, in the <code>Av</code> library.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span>'mode t</span></span><span> = <span><span>(<a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-subtitle\">Avutil.subtitle</a>, <span class=\"type-var\">'mode</span>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-codec\">codec</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>A subtitle codec.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-id\"><a href=\"#type-id\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> id</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-id.None\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.None\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`None</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Dvd_subtitle\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Dvd_subtitle\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Dvd_subtitle</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Dvb_subtitle\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Dvb_subtitle\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Dvb_subtitle</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Text\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Text\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Text</span></code></li><li id