e-id.Stl\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Stl</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Subviewer1\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Subviewer1\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Subviewer1</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Subviewer\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Subviewer\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Subviewer</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Subrip\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Subrip\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Subrip</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Webvtt\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Webvtt\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Webvtt</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Mpl2\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Mpl2\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Mpl2</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Vplayer\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Vplayer\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Vplayer</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Pjs\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Pjs\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Pjs</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Ass\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Ass\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Ass</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Hdmv_text_subtitle\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Hdmv_text_subtitle\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Hdmv_text_subtitle</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Ttml\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Ttml\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Ttml</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Arib_caption\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Arib_caption\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Arib_caption</span></code></li><li id=\"type-id.Ivtv_vbi\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-id.Ivtv_vbi\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Ivtv_vbi</span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The identifier of a subtitle format, FFmpeg's <code>AV_CODEC_ID_*</code> values of the subtitle family.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-descriptor\"><a href=\"#val-descriptor\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> descriptor : <span><a href=\"#type-id\">id</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-descriptor\">descriptor</a> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>descriptor id</code> is FFmpeg's descriptor of the format, <code>None</code> when FFmpeg has none for it. Every text of the result is a copy.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-codec_ids\"><a href=\"#val-codec_ids\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> codec_ids : \u000A  <span><span>[ `None\u000A  <span>| `Dvd_subtitle</span>\u000A  <span>| `Dvb_subtitle</span>\u000A  <span>| `Text</span>\u000A  <span>| `Xsub</span>\u000A  <span>| `Ssa</span>\u000A  <span>| `Mov_text</span>\u000A  <span>| `Hdmv_pgs_subtitle</span>\u000A  <span>| `Dvb_teletext</span>\u000A  <span>| `Srt</span>\u000A  <span>| `Microdvd</span>\u000A  <span>| `Eia_608</span>\u000A  <span>| `Jacosub</span>\u000A  <span>| `Sami</span>\u000A  <span>| `Realtext</span>\u000A  <span>| `Stl</span>\u000A  <span>| `Subviewer1</span>\u000A  <span>| `Subviewer</span>\u000A  <span>| `Subrip</span>\u000A  <span>| `Webvtt</span>\u000A  <span>| `Mpl2</span>\u000A  <span>| `Vplayer</span>\u000A  <span>| `Pjs</span>\u000A  <span>| `Ass</span>\u000A  <span>| `Hdmv_text_subtitle</span>\u000A  <span>| `Ttml</span>\u000A  <span>| `Arib_caption</span>\u000A  <span>| `Ivtv_vbi</span> ]</span>\u000A    list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Every subtitle identifier the bindings know.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-encoders\"><a href=\"#val-encoders\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> encoders : <span><span><a href=\"../index.html#type-encode\">encode</a> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The subtitle encoders FFmpeg registers, in FFmpeg's order. The list is built once, when this module is loaded. It holds the encoders whose identifier is in <a href=\"#type-id\"><code>id</code></a>, so <a href=\"#val-get_id\"><code>get_id</code></a> succeeds on each of them.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-decoders\"><a href=\"#val-decoders\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> decoders : <span><span><a href=\"../index.html#type-decode\">decode</a> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The subtitle decoders FFmpeg registers, under the rules of <a href=\"#val-encoders\"><code>encoders</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-find_encoder_by_name\"><a href=\"#val-find_encoder_by_name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> find_encoder_by_name : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-encode\">encode</a> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>find_encoder_by_name name</code> is the subtitle encoder FFmpeg registers under <code>name</code>.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"raises\"><span class=\"at-tag\">raises</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#exception-Error\"><code>Avutil.Error</code></a> <p>with <code>`Encoder_not_found</code> when FFmpeg has no encoder of that name, or has one that is not a subtitle codec.</p></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-find_encoder\"><a href=\"#val-find_encoder\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> find_encoder : <span><a href=\"#type-id\">id</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-encode\">encode</a> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>find_encoder id</code> is an encoder FFmpeg registers for the format <code>id</code>.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"raises\"><span class=\"at-tag\">raises</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#exception-Error\"><code>Avutil.Error</code></a> <p>with <code>`Encoder_not_found</code> when FFmpeg has no encoder for it.</p></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-find_decoder_by_name\"><a href=\"#val-find_decoder_by_name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> find_decoder_by_name : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-decode\">decode</a> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>find_decoder_by_name name</code> is the subtitle decoder FFmpeg registers under <code>name</code>.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"raises\"><span class=\"at-tag\">raises</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#exception-Error\"><code>Avutil.Error</code></a> <p>with <code>`Decoder_not_found</code> when FFmpeg has no decoder of that name, or has one that is not a subtitle codec.</p></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-find_decoder\"><a href=\"#val-find_decoder\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> find_decoder : <span><a href=\"#type-id\">id</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-decode\">decode</a> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>find_decoder id</code> is a decoder FFmpeg registers for the format <code>id</code>.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"raises\"><span class=\"at-tag\">raises</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#exception-Error\"><code>Avutil.Error</code></a> <p>with <code>`Decoder_not_found</code> when FFmpeg has no decoder for it.</p></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_name\"><a href=\"#val-get_name\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_name : <span><span><span>(<span class=\"type-var\">_</span>, <span class=\"type-var\">_</span>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-codec\">codec</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>get_name codec</code> is the codec's name, as <a href=\"../index.html#val-name\"><code>Avcodec.name</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_description\"><a href=\"#val-get_description\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_description : <span><span><span>(<span class=\"type-var\">_</span>, <span class=\"type-var\">_</span>)</span> <a href=\"../index.html#type-codec\">codec</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>get_description codec</code> is the codec's descriptive name, the empty string when FFmpeg gives none.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-string_of_id\"><a href=\"#val-string_of_id\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> string_of_id : <span><a href=\"#type-id\">id</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>string_of_id id</code> is FFmpeg's name of the format.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_id\"><a href=\"#val-get_id\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_id : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">_</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-id\">id</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>get_id codec</code> is the identifier of the format the codec implements.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"raises\"><span class=\"at-tag\">raises</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#exception-Error\"><code>Avutil.Error</code></a> <p>with <code>`Failure _</code> for a codec whose identifier is outside <a href=\"#type-id\"><code>id</code></a>. No codec of <a href=\"#val-encoders\"><code>encoders</code></a> or <a href=\"#val-decoders\"><code>decoders</code></a> is one.</p></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_params_id\"><a href=\"#val-get_params_id\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_params_id : <span><span><a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-subtitle\">Avutil.subtitle</a> <a href=\"../index.html#type-params\">params</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-id\">id</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>get_params_id params</code> is the codec identifier of the parameters.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"raises\"><span class=\"at-tag\">raises</span> <a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#exception-Error\"><code>Avutil.Error</code></a> <p>with <code>`Failure _</code> when the identifier is outside <a href=\"#type-id\"><code>id</code></a>.</p></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_width\"><a href=\"#val-get_width\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_width : <span><span><a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-subtitle\">Avutil.subtitle</a> <a href=\"../index.html#type-params\">params</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The size of the canvas a bitmap subtitle codec draws on, 0 when unset.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_height\"><a href=\"#val-get_height\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_height : <span><span><a href=\"../../../ffmpeg-avutil/Avutil/index.html#type-subtitle\">Avutil.subtitle</a> <a href=\"../index.html#type-params\">params</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div></div>"}